# Mobile-Responsive Design Patterns

## Responsive Grid Layout

### Main Content Grid
```typescript
// Mobile-first responsive grid
<div className="grid grid-cols-1 xl:grid-cols-3 gap-4 sm:gap-6">
  <div className="xl:col-span-2 space-y-4 sm:space-y-6">
    {/* Main content - 2 columns on desktop, 1 on mobile */}
  </div>
  <div className="space-y-4 sm:space-y-6">
    {/* Sidebar - 1 column on desktop, 1 on mobile */}
  </div>
</div>
```

### Tab Navigation
```typescript
// Responsive tab buttons
<Button
  variant={activeTab === 'search' ? 'default' : 'outline'}
  size="sm"
  className="flex items-center space-x-1 px-2 sm:px-3"
>
  <Search className="w-4 h-4" />
  <span className="hidden sm:inline">Search</span>
</Button>
```

## Mobile-Optimized Components

### Header with Responsive Sizing
```typescript
<div className="flex items-center space-x-2 sm:space-x-4">
  <Brain className="w-6 h-6 sm:w-8 sm:h-8 text-blue-600" />
  <h1 className="text-lg sm:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">AI Document Wizard</h1>
