## Mobile-Specific Patterns

### Hidden Elements on Mobile
```typescript
// Hide statistics on mobile, show on large screens
<div className="hidden lg:flex items-center space-x-4 text-sm text-gray-600">
  <div className="flex items-center space-x-1">
    <BarChart3 className="w-4 h-4" />
    <span>{queryHistory.statistics.total} queries</span>
  </div>
</div>
```

### Mobile-Optimized Text
```typescript
// Responsive text sizing
<h1 className="text-lg sm:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">AI Document Wizard</h1>
<p className="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600">Description text</p>
```

### Touch-Friendly Buttons
```typescript
// Minimum touch target size (44px)
<Button
  className="h-12 sm:h-14 px-6 sm:px-8" // Minimum 48px height
  size="lg"
>
  Button Text
</Button>
```

## Layout Breakpoints

### Tailwind CSS Breakpoints
- **sm**: 640px and up
- **md**: 768px and up  
- **lg**: 1024px and up
- **xl**: 1280px and up

### Component Breakpoint Strategy
```typescript
// Mobile-first approach
className="
  text-sm sm:text-base lg:text-lg    // Text sizing
  p-3 sm:p-4 lg:p-6                  // Padding
  space-y-2 sm:space-y-4 lg:space-y-6 // Spacing
  grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3 // Grid layout
"
```

## Performance Considerations

### Conditional Rendering
```typescript
// Only render heavy components on larger screens
{isLargeScreen && (
  <ComplexAnalyticsComponent />
)}

// Use CSS to hide/show instead of conditional rendering when possible
<div className="hidden lg:block">
  <AnalyticsWidget />
</div>
```

### Mobile-Optimized Images
```typescript
// Responsive image sizing
<Image
  src="/images/logo.svg"
  alt="Logo"
  width={24}
  height={24}
  className="w-6 h-6 sm:w-8 sm:h-8"
/>
```